      "declarations": [
        {
          "kind": "class",
          "description": "Create, import and play scores. A score is stored as alphaTab JSON in a\n`<script type=\"application/json\" slot=\"data\" data-music-score>` child; without it the widget starts with a blank score.\nMusicXML files (`.musicxml`, `.xml`, `.mxl`, up to 8 MiB) are imported through the `importMusicXML` action.\n\nMusic Score bundles alphaTab 1.9.0 under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/).\nThe bundled JavaScript keeps the upstream copyright and license notices. `scripts/alphatab.mjs` reproduces the changes\napplied to the pinned release (https://github.com/CoderLine/alphaTab/releases/tag/v1.9.0).",
          "name": "WebwriterMusicScore",
          "cssParts": [
            {
              "description": "The paper the score is engraved on (a white sheet with black ink).",
              "name": "sheet"
            },
            {
              "description": "The status line that reports an unreadable score or a notation change. Theme: the interface follows `--ww-text-color` and `--ww-font-family` of the document. The selection, the playback cursor and the focus ring use `--ww-theme-accent-1` (give it enough contrast on white). The engraving fonts stay fixed, because alphaTab measures the score with them. Files: MusicXML (`.musicxml`, `.xml`, `.mxl`) can be imported through `convertFrom`; the whole file is parsed before the score is replaced. The score exports as a MIDI file (`audio/midi`: notes, tempo, instruments and repeats; engraving, lyrics and text are dropped) and as a Guitar Pro 7 file (`.gp`). alphaTab has no MusicXML writer, so MusicXML is import only. There are no signals: nothing in this widget has a value that another widget could use. Keyboard: when score editing is available, every note, rest, beat and score text is a tab stop. Enter or Space selects it, arrow keys move, and typing opens the entry field. Touch: tap selects, a drag moves a note or changes its pitch. Print: the score prints without controls.",
              "name": "notice"
            }
          ],
          "members": [
